<title>USA: Master Glazier's to sell assets.</title>
<headline>Master Glazier's to sell assets.</headline>
<dateline>PISCATAWAY, N.J. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Master Glazier's Karate International Inc said on Monday that is has agreements to sell substantially all assets from four of its martial arts instruction centers to affiliates of Tiger Schulmann's Karate.</p>
<p>The company said will benefit from the transaction through the release from certain liabilities.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said that Master Glazier's will have three centers still open after the sale.</p>
